{"id": "EUVD-2026-105096", "enisaUuid": "f0b7a281-8030-3a16-8ce9-6009bbf5e0ca", "description": "HarfBuzz from 8.0.0 through 14.6.0 contains a NULL pointer dereference vulnerability in the experimental WebAssembly shaper host imports buffer_set_contents, face_create, and font_set_coords. Attackers can supply a crafted font whose embedded wasm module passes out-of-range addresses with non-zero lengths, crashing any application that shapes text with the font.", "datePublished": "2026-10-20T15:40:41", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T15:54:08", "baseScore": 6.8, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:L/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:P/VC:N/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/harfbuzz/harfbuzz/pull/6414", "https://github.com/harfbuzz/harfbuzz/commit/a71aa86c2bac114fafb6b47f8da02024ecb44fa6", "https://github.com/harfbuzz/harfbuzz/blob/14.6.0/src/hb-wasm-api-buffer.hh#L153-L181", "https://github.com/harfbuzz/harfbuzz/blob/14.6.0/src/hb-wasm-api-face.hh#L34-L49", "https://github.com/harfbuzz/harfbuzz/blob/14.6.0/src/hb-wasm-api-font.hh#L241-L258", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/harfbuzz-8.0.0-through-14.6.0-webassembly-shaper-null-pointer-dereference-dos"], "aliases": ["GHSA-2fqx-2h7j-c7gq", "CVE-2026-113680"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.13, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "34382173-2bd3-398b-b220-6869539cd9fa", "product": {"name": "harfbuzz", "vendor": {"name": "harfbuzz"}}, "product_version": "8.0.0 \u226414.6.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "ec6c48a9-54a5-3c49-b593-3f9596adf4a1", "vendor": {"name": "harfbuzz"}}], "isExploited": false}